Design a 2-input AND gate with additional logic to incorporate three inputs (A1, A2, and B1) and produce an output Y. The output Y is high when both A1 and A2 are high, or when A1 is low while A2 is high and B1 is low, or when A2 is low while A1 is high and B1 is low, or when both A1 and A2 are low and B1 is high. This module enables combinational logic functionality that extends binary operations beyond simple AND/OR conditions by integrating negated states of inputs.
